{
	quest.01FE9F0ED54217B9.quest_desc: ["The start to &c&lCreate Crafts and Additions&r is the Rolling Mill. \\n\\nThe Rolling Mill is like 2 tiny &8Crushing Wheels&r put into one Machine. \\n\\nGive it &dRotational Power&r and you can Drop Items from the top of it to Roll them out into new ones. \\n\\nIngots into Bars and Plates into Wires. We'll need Wires for Moving &cEnergy&r!"]
	quest.01FE9F0ED54217B9.title: "&c&lCreate Crafts and Additions"
	quest.03B4A210003B2DB9.quest_desc: ["One of the most recognizable parts of Steam Locomotives is the Chimney! \\n\\nAnd what's better to represent the Chimney than a Chute?"]
	quest.03B4A210003B2DB9.title: "A Chimney!"
	quest.04F14A8529000047.quest_desc: ["&aPortable Energy Interfaces&r (PEIs) help move &cEnergy&r from &cAccumulators&r on &aContraptions&r. \\n\\nWhen a &aContraption&r has an &cAccumulator&r and a PEI thats 1 or 2 Blocks away from another PEI, the &aContraption&r will freeze and connect them. \\n\\nThis will either move &cEnergy&r to the &cAccumulator&r on the &aContraption&r or from it, depending on what &cConnector&r is used on the non-&aContraption &cPEI&r."]
	quest.04F14A8529000047.quest_subtitle: "Energy with Contraptions"
	quest.04F14A8529000047.title: "&aPortable Energy Interface"
	quest.0C16AE97561799CA.quest_desc: ["The most obvious part of &d&lCreate: Dragons Plus&r is additions to &2&lMinecraft&r (and &l&cD&6y&ee&an&ba&9m&5i&dc&cs&r) &cD&ey&ae&bs&r! \\n\\nHere we can Mix &9Water&r and &cD&ey&ae&bs&r to create &cF&6l&eu&ai&bd &9D&5y&de&r. \\n\\nThis &cF&6l&eu&ai&bd &9D&5y&de&r will &cD&ey&be&r any Items or Entities that Drop into it. Same happens at range if you use an &6Encased Fan&r on it! \\n\\nIf you Heat the &6Mixer&r it will separate the &cD&ey&be&r and &9Water&r."]
	quest.0C16AE97561799CA.title: "&d&lCreate: Dragon's Plus"
	quest.111BEBC0C5497F51.quest_desc: ["&aExperience Lanters&r suck up &aXP Orbs&r and even your own &aXP&r! \\n\\nIt will only take &aXP&r from you if you're a Block away from it though. &aXP Orbs&r have higher range for it. \\n\\n&aXP&r collected will be turned into &aFluid Experience&r. This can be Piped into Tanks, even working through &aContraptions&r."]
	quest.111BEBC0C5497F51.title: "&aExperience Lantern"
	quest.1DDB902F21833644.quest_desc: ["Printers are sort of like fancy Spouts. \\nThey are used to either copy or change certain paper related Items. From Schedules, to Books and Quill, to even &5Enchanted Books&r! \\n\\nEach Item that needs to be Printed gets put into the filter slot, like the &5Enchanted Book&r. \\n\\nThen, the Printer will need a specific Fluid for what it's Printing. &aFluid Experience&r for &5Enchanted Books&r, &0Black Dye&r for Books and Quill, and Dye to change Name Tags! \\n\\nObviously the Item that is getting Printed on to will need to be below the Printer to work."]
	quest.1EC999B0056CF49D.quest_desc: ["The &7Blaze Forger&r works similar to a &5Blaze Enchanter&r in drinking &aFluid Experience&r (and being upgraded with &bCake o' Enchanting&r), but it does a few different mechanics with Items. \\n\\nInstead of acting like an &5Enchantment Table&r, this guy acts like an &7Anvil&r. He has 3 different Modes you can toggle with his panel. \\n\\nMerge: merges Items together to share &5Enchantments&r, fix Durability, or combine &aEnchanting Templates&r. \\n\\nApply: will put &5Enchantment Books&r or &aEnchanting Templates&r onto Items. \\n\\nExtract: takes off a single &5Enchantment&r from an Item and puts it onto an &aEnchanting Template&r."]
	quest.1EC999B0056CF49D.title: "&7Blaze Forger"
	quest.1FBB07F775ACEAFB.quest_desc: ["&6Affix Augmentors&r are like &9Gem Cutters&r, just for &6Affixes&r. \\n\\nPlace the &6Augmentor&r on a Belt or Depot. Then, it will need a Tank full of &6Apoethic Essence&r below it. \\n\\nOnce Items go through it, it will use some &6Apotheothic Essence&r and will upgrade the &6Affixes&r on the Item."]
	quest.1FBB07F775ACEAFB.title: "&6Affix Augmentor"
	quest.2B288618DB30D393.quest_desc: ["&bElectric Pumps&r are a lot like &bMechanical Pumps&r. \\n\\nJust keep the Pump part, and replace the Mechanical part with Electric. \\n\\nIt can take &cEnergy&r from the sides, holding at most 5kFE. You can also toggle the Speed it Pumps Fluids at with the &bElectric Pump&r. \\n\\nThe faster the Speed, the more &cEnergy&r it uses."]
	quest.2B288618DB30D393.title: "&bElectric Pump"
	quest.2B8E945E461F0478.quest_desc: ["&aExperience Hatch&r attaches to &bTanks&r or other Blocks that hold &aExperience&r. \\n\\nYou can Right Click to dump all of your &aXP&r into &aFluid XP&r or Shift Right Click to take it back. \\n\\nBy default, it will take and give everything it can hold. You can toggle it to change that."]
	quest.2B8E945E461F0478.title: "&aExperience Hatch"
	quest.2C0ADCB3E3E0585E.quest_desc: ["You'll need to see ahead of the &5Train&r even in the Dark, so why not use a &eHeadlight&r! \\n\\nOr plenty of other &eLight Sources&r from various different Mods..."]
	quest.2C0ADCB3E3E0585E.title: "A Headlight"
	quest.2C2B27AC79C4500C.quest_desc: ["&6&lCreate&r and &6&lCreate Bells and Whistles&r gives us a ton of options for Ladders to help us up on our &5Trains&r. \\n\\nLadders, Steps, and Grab Bars all work the same, just with different looks. \\n\\nThe Doorsteps are different though, they just act like a tiny ledge."]
	quest.2C8027EEE9C666DA.quest_desc: ["Affix Templates are used with the &6Blaze Composer&r to move and merge &6Affixes&r. \\n\\n&6Brass&r and &9Crystal&r Affix Templates are used with the normal &6Blaze Composer&r while the &dApotheotic Affix Template&r is for the &6&oSuper Blaze Composer&r. \\n\\nEach only hold 1 &6Affix&r each, but the type of Template will determine what Level of &6Affixes&r it can hold. &6Brass&r holds 1, &9Crystal&r holds 2, and &dApotheotic&r holds 4."]
	quest.2C8027EEE9C666DA.title: "Affix Templates"
	quest.2CF78ADBB4D009D0.quest_desc: ["From Steam Locomotives, to modern Trains, to even Bullet Trains... there is no easy way to make those shapes with Blocks. \\n\\nThankfully we have Framed Blocks which would make those shapes much easier to make. \\n\\nI highly recommend using the Slopes, Buttons, and Trapdoors!|"]
	quest.2CF78ADBB4D009D0.title: "Train Shaped?"
	quest.30FEFA86F6795DA4.quest_desc: ["&cWire Spools&r attach &cConnectors&r to other &cConnectors&r. \\n\\nJust Right Click one &cConnector&r with the &cSpool&r, then Right Click the other to place down the &cWire&r. \\n\\nTo take the &cWire&r down, use the Empty Spool on the &cConnector&r. \\n\\n&6Copper Wires&r can only Connect &cSmall Connectors&r, while the rest can Connect to &cLarge Connectors&r. \\n\\n&2F&ce&2s&ct&2i&cv&2e &cL&2i&cg&2h&ct&2s&r are the same as &6Copper&r, just prettier with Christmas Lights on them!"]
	quest.30FEFA86F6795DA4.title: "&cWire Spools"
	quest.32FDE2C1E535B1D6.quest_desc: ["I don't think I've ever seen a single person actually use a &3Conduit&r. Maybe they don't know how? Maybe it's too complicated? Maybe it's just not worth it! \\n\\nWhatever the reason, this &3&lAddon&r makes it cheaper, simpler, and better! \\n\\nThe &3Conduit Cage&r doesn't need to be &9underwater&r or surrounded by certain Blocks, instead it just needs &9Water&r Piped into it. \\n\\nWhen &9Water&r is Piped into the Bottom of it, it will start up giving &3Conduit Power&r to all Mobs and Players nearby. \\n\\nDon't want all Mobs and Players to get it? Then, you can toggle on the sides of the &3Conduit Cage&r to set who or what gets it. \\n\\nIf you Pipe in &dFluid Potions&r instead of &9Water&r, it will give that Potion Effect to whatever is nearby!"]
	quest.32FDE2C1E535B1D6.quest_subtitle: "Conduit Cage"
	quest.32FDE2C1E535B1D6.title: "&3&lCreate Aquatic Ambitions"
	quest.33B8ECD54C33FB1E.quest_desc: ["&cAccumulators&r are Energy Storage Blocks. Also Multiblock Energy Storage! \\nYou can combine multiple into 2x2 or 3x3 all the way up to 3x3x5. This will combine all their Storage. \\n\\nEach one can carry 2MFE. \\n\\nYou can use the top or bottom sides to Input and Output &cEnergy&r!"]
	quest.33B8ECD54C33FB1E.title: "&cAccumulator"
	quest.3400F404ED9AD145.quest_desc: ["Bastions in the &c&lNether&r have Netherite Templates as well as Blaze Burner Templates. \\n\\nWe'll need these to make &5Blaze Enchanters&r and &7Blaze Forgers&r."]
	quest.3400F404ED9AD145.title: "Blaze Burner Upgrade"
	quest.340FF559EAA909E2.quest_desc: ["&aNuggets of Experience&r will be necessary for a lot of Crafts with &6&lCreate Enchantment Industry&r. \\n\\nThere's a few ways to get them, all involving &6&lCreate&r Machines. &8Crushing Wheels&r that Crush Ore, &8Crushing Wheels&r that Kill Mobs, and &6Deployers&r that Kill Mobs can Drop it. \\n\\nYou can Right Click them to use them up to gain the &aExperience&r."]
	quest.340FF559EAA909E2.title: "&6&lCreate Enchantment Industry"
	quest.349E20E117634D33.quest_desc: ["That's why its called &d&lDragons Plus&r! \\n\\n&d&lCreate: Dragons Plus&r makes it much easier to farm and use &dDragon's Breath&r. \\n\\nNow, tossing &dDragon's Breath&r into an &bItem Drain&r will give us &dFluid Dragon's Breath&r. This can be used in Buckets to be moved or Placed down like any other Fluid. \\n\\nWe can farm &dDragon's Breath&r by placing a Dripstone below &dFluid Dragon's Breath&r, with a Cauldron beneath it. The Cauldron will slowly fill up with free &dDragon's Breath&r. \\n\\nTossing &dFluid Dragon's Breath&r into a &6Mixer&r with &dPotions&r will make Lingering Potions... in Fluid form."]
	quest.349E20E117634D33.title: "&dFluid Dragon's Breath"
	quest.387973CD4EF9057B.quest_desc: ["As we stated before, &7Blaze Forgers&r can be upgraded as to well to &7&oSuper Blaze Forgers&r. \\n\\n&7&oSuper Blaze Forgers&r are used the same way, but will use &bSuper Enchanting Templates&r instead of normal ones. \\n\\n&7&oSuper Blaze Forgers&r aren't restricted by &2&lVanilla&r limits, whether the Level of &5Enchantment&r or contradicting &5Enchantments&r, like Silk Touch and Fortune. \\n\\nAlso like &5&oSuper Blaze Enchanters&r, you'll need a Lightning Rod nearby to avoid losing the &7&oForger&r to Lightning."]
	quest.387973CD4EF9057B.title: "&7&oSuper Blaze Forger"
	quest.3A57C0B9D9FF9DB4.quest_desc: ["However you get it, &aFluid Experience&r or &aBucket O' Enchanting&r is necessary for many functions in &6&lCreate Enchanting Industry&r. \\n\\nYou can Place it on the ground and it will form a singular &aXP Orb&r. \\n\\nYou can place it in Tanks and move it with Pipes. \\n\\nOr even just use the &aBucket&r on Machines that need &aFluid Experience&r like &5Blaze Enchanters &for &7Forgers&r."]
	quest.3A57C0B9D9FF9DB4.title: "&aFluid Experience"
	quest.3BA838FDB8FEE5FF.quest_desc: ["&6Blaze Composers&r work very similar to &7Blaze Forgers&r, just with &6Affixes&r! \\n\\nThey can Extract &6Affixes&r and place them on Templates, Merge two Templates together, or Apply a Template to an Item. \\n\\nThey'll need &6Apotheothic Essence&r to work, like &7Forgers&r need &aFluid Experience&r. "]
	quest.3BA838FDB8FEE5FF.title: "&6Blaze Composer"
	quest.41FCA8A3777A28A1.quest_desc: ["&6Apotheothic Essence&r is used with a lot of Machines, so let's make some! \\n\\nToss some &5Arcane Sands&r into a Basin under a &6Mechanical Mixer&r and it'll mix it up into &6Apoethic Essence&r. \\n\\nYep, it's that easy!"]
	quest.41FCA8A3777A28A1.title: "&6Apotheothic Essence"
	quest.421CC1438CB78C30.quest_desc: ["Just &6Press&r a &bBlock of Super Experience &rand you'll get a &bSuper Enchanting Template&r. \\n\\nThese are needed for &5&oSuper Blaze Enchanters&r and &7&oSuper Blaze Forgers&r."]
	quest.421CC1438CB78C30.title: "&bSuper Enchanting Templates"
	quest.42BF03EFA79B720E.quest_desc: ["&7Mechanical Grindstones&r are automated versions of the &2&lVanilla&r &7Grindstone&r. With more features of course! \\n\\nPlace one &7Mechanical Grindstone&r in an &bItem Drain&r, with a second one on top, then give both &dRotational Power&r. \\n\\nWhen Items go through it they'll make &aFluid Experience&r and might give the Items back depending on what went through. \\n\\nIf a &aNugget of Experience&f, &aBlock of Experience&f, or&a Bottle o' Enchanting&r go through they'll be turned directly into &aFluid Experience&r. If an &5Enchanted Item&r goes through, it'll void the &5Enchantments&r and give back &aExperience&r and the Item. \\n\\nAnother function with the &7Mechanical Grindstone&r is that it will Sand Items, like with Sandpaper."]
	quest.42BF03EFA79B720E.title: "&7Mechanical Grindstones"
	quest.440D66B93CCEB98E.quest_desc: ["When a &bBlock of Experience&r is struck by Lightning it (might) turn into a &bBlock of Super Experience&r. \\n\\nWe'll need these for an even greater source of &5Enchantments&r with &5&oSuper Blaze Enchanters&r."]
	quest.440D66B93CCEB98E.title: "&bBlock of Super Experience"
	quest.44EFB641E6492700.quest_desc: ["Straws are accessories to &6Blaze Burners&r. \\n\\nOnce given a Straw, the &6Blaze Burner&r will take in Fluid Fuels like &cLava&r to power them. \\n\\nYou can hand feed them Buckets of Fuel or Pipe it in."]
	quest.4755E9E19D89FBDE.quest_desc: ["Making &5Trains&r is easy! Making &5Trains&r look good is hard... \\n\\nHere's some tips that can help make them look better!"]
	quest.4755E9E19D89FBDE.title: "Decorating &5Trains"
	quest.4803EF7C6A0FA53B.quest_desc: ["Takes in &dRotational Power&r, gives out &cEnergy&r."]
	quest.4803EF7C6A0FA53B.quest_subtitle: "Rotational Power -> Energy"
	quest.4803EF7C6A0FA53B.title: "&cAlternator"
	quest.48AB303F230749F0.quest_desc: ["&bCakes o' Enchanting&r are needed to upgrade our &5Blaze Enchanters&f and &7Forgers&r. \\n\\nThey're made by filling a &9Cake Base O' Enchanting&r with &aFluid Experience&r from a &bSpout&r. \\n\\n&9Cake Bases o' Enchanting&r are made by compacting an Egg, Sugar, and &9Lapis Lazuli&r in a Basin with a &6Mechanical Press&r. \\n\\n&9Lapis&r? Ohhh like for &5Enchanting&r, because you use &9Lapis&r to &5Enchant&r. I got it now."]
	quest.48AB303F230749F0.title: "&bCake o' Enchanting"
	quest.4B0A0F0CAA1CFDAF.quest_desc: ["This &9Gem Cutter&r sits on Belts or Depots and will do what the &9Gem Cutter Table&r does, just automatically! \\n\\nYou'll need a Tank below the &9Gem Cutter&r in order to feed it &9Crystal Essence&r. \\n\\nThen, once the Gem is in the &9Gem Cutter&r it will take some &9Crystal Essence&r and start upgrading your Gem."]
	quest.4B0A0F0CAA1CFDAF.title: "&9Gem Cutter"
	quest.4E9B335A9F0D039E.quest_desc: ["Old &5Trains&r are very recognizable for the Cowcatchers/Pilots on front. \\n\\nMost new &5Trains&r don't use them, they'd probably make them even more dangerous if they did... \\n\\nBut if you are building an older &5Train&r than these are perfect!"]
	quest.4E9B335A9F0D039E.title: "Cowcatchers"
	quest.55EC5B3CD0843514.quest_desc: ["Takes in &cEnergy&r, gives out &dRotational Power&r."]
	quest.55EC5B3CD0843514.quest_subtitle: "Rotational Power <- Energy"
	quest.55EC5B3CD0843514.title: "&dElectric Motor"
	quest.561B00FDC42181D5.quest_desc: ["A pretty simple Block, just attach it to &bFluid Tanks&r to either Empty or Fill Buckets."]
	quest.561B00FDC42181D5.title: "&bFluid Hatch"
	quest.5A525A8C38C9302D.quest_desc: ["This Quest has been authored by &6AllTheMods Staff&r, or a &2Community contributor&r for use in AllTheMods Modpacks.\\n\\nAs all &6AllTheMods&r packs are licensed under &eAll Rights Reserved&r, this Quest is not allowed to be used in any public packs not released by &6AllTheMods Team&r without explicit permission.\\n\\nThis quest is intentionally hidden, if you're seeing this, you're in editing mode."]
	quest.5A72ACC4FD42156E.quest_desc: ["Here we're just going to talk about making &aEnchantment Templates&r. We'll learn about how to use them in later Quests. \\n\\nSimply use a &6Mechanical Press&r on a &aBlock of Experience&r."]
	quest.5A72ACC4FD42156E.title: "&aEnchanting Templates"
	quest.5C7161A76E3916D1.quest_desc: ["Man these Mods include a lot of slavery... \\n\\nThe &5Starbuncle Wheel&r will automatically be powered 24/7 by our &6Starbuncle&r to make &dRotational Power&r. \\n\\nIt rotates at 16RPM and has 256 Stress Units."]
	quest.5C7161A76E3916D1.quest_subtitle: "The Starbuncle Wheel"
	quest.5C7161A76E3916D1.title: "&5&lArs Creo"
	quest.5D48DC1C6F3FEE62.quest_desc: ["&9Crystal Essence&r is pretty simple to make. \\n\\nJust mix &9Gem Dust&r with a&6 Mechanical Mixer&r. \\n\\nThat's it."]
	quest.5D48DC1C6F3FEE62.title: "&9Crystal Essence"
	quest.5DC592E9FDDB2753.quest_desc: ["When Blowing an &6Encased Fan&r through a powered &3Conduit Cage&r, it will do what's called &3Bulk Channeling&r. \\n\\nThis, like most Bulk things, will affect Items in it. \\n\\nThis can revive Dead Coral, Oxidize &6Copper&r, and make easier Recipes for certain Ocean related Items like &3Hearts of the Sea&r and &3Prismarine&r."]
	quest.5DC592E9FDDB2753.title: "&3Channeling&r through a &6Fan"
	quest.65F491B62599A173.quest_desc: ["Train Doors don't work like normal &2&lMinecraft&r Doors, thankfully neither do &6&lCreate's&r Doors! \\n\\nThe &7Andesite &fand &6Copper&r Doors will fold in half and move to the side. \\n\\n&6Brass&f, &5Train&r, and Glass Doors will Slide. If you have 2 next to each other as well, both will Slide in opposite directions. "]
	quest.65F491B62599A173.title: "Train Doors"
	quest.682023ED35B78D3F.quest_desc: ["The &dInfuser&r acts like an automatic &5Enchantment Table&r... just only for &dInfusing&r. This is important for quite a few Recipes. \\n\\nPlace the &dInfuser&r above a Basin, and place Bookshelves on the same 2 levels as the &dInfuser&r. \\n\\nFor each recipe you'll need the exact same &aEterna&f, &cQuanta&f, and &5Arcana&r Stats as you would with the normal &5Enchanting Table&r. The &6Brass Bookshelf&r can help a ton with this! \\n\\nYou'll need to Pipe in &aFluid Experience&r to the &dInfuser&r and place the Item (or Fluid like &dDragon's Breath&r) into the Basin. Then, if everything is right, it'll start &dInfusing&r!"]
	quest.682023ED35B78D3F.title: "Automatic &dInfusion"
	quest.68B1B42F4601AF2E.quest_desc: ["That's not all you can do! \\n\\nYou can also just place them down like normal &9Water Buckets&r. \\n\\nIf &cLava&r touches the &cF&6l&eu&ai&bd &9D&5y&de&r, it will make Concrete. \\n\\nAnd you can use them in Printers to Color Name Tags! \\n\\nThat's about it..."]
	quest.68B1B42F4601AF2E.title: "Buckets full of &cD&ey&ae&bs"
	quest.6DAD2AB348A8374E.quest_desc: ["Combining 9 &aNuggets of Experience&r will give us a &aBlock of Experience&r. \\n\\nNow we can start having fun with the Mod!"]
	quest.6DAD2AB348A8374E.title: "&aBlock of Experience"
	quest.6FFB66C5E49B12BE.quest_desc: ["&cCapacitors&r are &c&lCreate Craft and Additions&r versions of Batteries. "]
	quest.6FFB66C5E49B12BE.title: "&cCapacitor"
	quest.71DA505587022FE0.quest_desc: ["&5Blaze Enchanters&r are our little factories for &5Enchantment&r automation. \\n\\nThey use &aFluid Experience&r to work. You can Pipe it in or hand feed them. \\n\\nThey have a Panel on their side which controls the &5Enchantment Level&r it is set to. From 0 to 50 (for now). \\n\\nJust toss your Items on top and it will start &5Enchanting&r them at the set level, using &aFluid Experience&r as fuel. \\n\\nOr you can set a Filter by placing the Item right above the Panel. This will now let us &5Enchant&r our &aEnchantment Templates&r instead of Gear. \\n\\nThe &aTemplates&r will hold whatever &5Enchantments&r would normally go onto the filter Item."]
	quest.71DA505587022FE0.title: "&5Blaze Enchanter"
	quest.77E2357B1B812777.quest_desc: ["&dInfusions&r need very specific Stats of &aEterna&f, &cQuanta&f, and &5Arcana&r. \\n\\nUsually this involves going through multiple setups of Bookshelves and Blocks to get the perfect amount... but we don't have time for that. Just use the &6Brass Bookshelf&r! \\n\\nThe &6Brass Bookshelf&r has configurable Stats. The top will toggle between &aEterna&f, &cQuanta&f, and &5Arcana&r while the side changes the percent of which is chosen. Each goes up to 25%. \\n\\nThe &6Brass Bookshelf&r will need &dRotational Power&r from below in order to actually work though. \\n\\nBut yes, it does work like a normal Bookshelf for &5Enchanting Tables&r and &dInfusers&r!"]
	quest.77E2357B1B812777.title: "&6Brass Bookshelf"
	quest.794535DA9CBD2CCB.quest_desc: ["&cConnectors&r are &c&lCreate Crafts and Additions&r way of moving &cEnergy&r. Similar to &5&lDraconic Evolution&r or &7&lImmersive Engineering&r. \\n\\nAll &cConnectors&r are placed onto Blocks and attach &cWire&r between them. \\n\\n&cSmall Connectors&r can connect to 4 &cConnectors&r while &cLarge Connectors&r can connect to 6 of them, but can't use &6Copper Wire&r. \\n\\nYou'll need a Wrench to change whether the &cConnector&r Pushes, Pulls, or doesn't do either. \\n\\nThe &cSmall Connector&r with a Light will light up when it receives &cEnergy&r."]
	quest.794535DA9CBD2CCB.title: "&cConnectors"
	quest.7B45497A71DDC185.quest_desc: ["When a &5Blaze Enchanter&r is fed a &bCake o' Enchanting&r it will turn into a &5&oSuper Blaze Enchanter&r. \\n\\nThese guys will no longer &5Enchant&r Gear or &aEnchanting Templates&r, they work exclusively with &bSuper Enchanting Templates&r. \\n\\n(The filtering for them works the same as normal &aEnchanting Templates&r.) \\n\\n&5&oSuper Enchanters&r can go up to Level 100 and can also find &6Treasure Enchantments&r, which normal &5Blaze Enchanters&r can't do. \\n\\nOnce it finishes an &5Enchantment&r, Lightning will Strike. If there's no Lightning Rods nearby, it'll Strike the &5&oSuper Enchanter&r... breaking it... and ruining your &5Enchantment&r... "]
	quest.7B45497A71DDC185.title: "&5&oSuper Blaze Enchanter"
	quest.7C96F1239A0BB6D7.quest_desc: ["&6Tesla Coils&r can be fed &cEnergy&r and be placed above a Depot to Charge Items. \\n\\nItems like the &cCapacitor&r, Jetpacks, and pretty much anything that uses Energy. \\n\\nYou can also give a &6Tesla Coil&r a &cRedstone Signal&r so instead of Charging Items, it will Damage and Shock any Entities near! \\n\\nShock Effect will freeze you, and Mobs, in place."]
	quest.7C96F1239A0BB6D7.title: "&6Tesla Coil"
	quest.7E4455E456E58340.quest_desc: ["Handing a &6Blaze Composer&r a &6Godforged Pearl&r will activate its &6&oSuper Blaze Composer&r mode. \\n\\nNow, it will only use &dApotheotic&r Affix Templates taking on higher level &6Affixes&r. \\n\\nBe careful though, like other &oSuper Machines&r, it will cause a Lightning Strike when working. If there's no Lightning Rods, the &6&oBlaze Composer&r will be Hit, breaking it."]
	quest.7E4455E456E58340.title: "&6&oSuper Blaze Composer"
